            "ref": "refs/changes/70/80270/6",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "Patrick NC Lin",
                "email": "patrick.nc.lin.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                "username": "PatrickLinww"
            },
            "createdOn": 1747187524,
            "author": {
                "name": "Patrick NC Lin",
                "email": "patrick.nc.lin.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                "username": "PatrickLinww"
            },
            "kind": "NO_CODE_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick NC Lin",
                        "email": "patrick.nc.lin.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "PatrickLinww"
                    },
                    "message": "The CI build is failing due to compilation errors involving sdbusplus and boost::asio. Specifically:\n\nasync_wait Errors:\nThe function async_wait in boost::asio::posix::basic_descriptor fails with the following error:\n```\n/usr/local/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp:377:20: error: no matching member function for call to 'async_wait'\nsocket.async_wait(boost::asio::posix::stream_descriptor::wait_read, ...);\n```\npost Errors:\nThe calls to boost::asio::post fail with:\n```\n/usr/local/include/sdbusplus/asio/connection.hpp:415:9: error: no matching function for call to 'post'\nboost::asio::post(io_, std::bind_front(&connection::process, this));\n```\n\nI also noticed that several other commits in entity-manager are failing to build for the same reasons.\nThe possible causes might include a version mismatch between sdbusplus and asio or issues with C++23 compatibility.\nPlease help look into this issue and provide guidance or a solution.\nThank you!"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Failures are in code unrelated to this change (clang-20 issues)."
                }
            ],
